{"title":"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> terms and the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> terms of a given arithmetic progression are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, \nrespectively, then the sum of first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79dc7d13216568e73c831d7b8c14c1a30f7831a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$110$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> terms is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/d/07dd7f1ce4874aef0995852168e9f10456338cc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ 90 \\qquad \\text{(B)} \\ -90 \\qquad \\text{(C)} \\ 110 \\qquad \\text{(D)} \\ -110 \\qquad \\text{(E)} \\ -100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"469\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> be the first term and common difference of the sequence, respectively.\n</p><p>The sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/5/49581879af98bbdbe1a20171963aae79790c6382.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10}{2}(2a+9d)=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"149\" height=\"38\" />. This equation can be simplified to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/a/3aac8b04ac70618f81580d49c1421eed78560171.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a+9d=20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>The sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/1/a41adfad85c3f6f2a9963402781406b9892b1c7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100}{2}(2a+99d)=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"158\" height=\"38\" />. This equation can be simplified to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/1/0e16dd2e8bd9a0463e07435d17bb244e04195af5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a+99d=\\frac{1}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"108\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Solving the system of these two equations yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/2/a62436a1ddcbed623ef70a713119974b78ad5f94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, d) = \\left(\\frac{1099}{100}, -\\frac{11}{50}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"178\" height=\"45\" />.  Therefore, the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79dc7d13216568e73c831d7b8c14c1a30f7831a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$110$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/9/7991fa0a6fb50e5cd8f81090d57de2a294361813.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{110}{2}(2a+109d)=55\\left(2\\cdot\\frac{1099}{100} + 109 \\cdot -\\frac{11}{50}\\right) = 55 \\cdot -2 = \\boxed{(\\textbf{D}) -110}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"551\" height=\"45\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab39d761413804680d26d972381f028001562f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e97a8af68fbc8e357d3ee0eba452022b06c1875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, ..., <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/1/6f1a2b6b7c193f9ba2b2134a59f1da5addcfbc98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" /> be the terms of this arithmetic sequence, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> be its common difference.  Recall that in an arithmetic sequence with an even number of terms, the mean of the middle two terms equals the mean of all terms in the sequence.  \n</p><p>The mean of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/7/c07ae2103b9efab6d1ee2a7ce238757a4f8a14e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a_5 + a_6}{2} = \\frac{100}{10} = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"160\" height=\"38\" />, while the mean of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/2/f0221f65de12c395996746f96afb5d718b2f9628.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a_{50}+a_{51}}{2} = \\frac{10}{100} = \\frac{1}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"177\" height=\"38\" />.  \n</p><p>Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/2/bc2804411af1f76a0afcb3bb690757fb8f56cc18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{10} = \\frac{a_{50}+a_{51}}{2} = \\frac{a_5 + 45d + a_6 + 45d}{2} = \\frac{a_5+a_6}{2} + 45d = 10 + 45d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"533\" height=\"39\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/8/688baa2029f9bceb7e3f5739095f91fdbb4c3288.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = -\\frac{11}{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"72\" height=\"38\" />.  So the mean of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79dc7d13216568e73c831d7b8c14c1a30f7831a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$110$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/a/67a6dcc2af7100bb8c3bf0d70b536cce018c68fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a_{55}+a_{56}}{2} = \\frac{a_{50}+5d+a_{51}+5d}{2} = \\frac{a_{50}+a_{51}}{2}+5d=\\frac{1}{10}+5\\cdot-\\frac{11}{50}=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"568\" height=\"39\" />.  Therefore, the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79dc7d13216568e73c831d7b8c14c1a30f7831a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$110$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/4/434f99abd29141ab93faf32e3e1d997656354e34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$110 \\cdot -1 =  \\boxed{(\\textbf{D}) -110}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"179\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME\" title=\"1980 AHSME\">1980 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1980 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1980\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017150305\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 226/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6087/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.628      1 -total\n 64.08%    9.373      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 34.45%    5.039      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13176:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017150305 and revision id 255571. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}